# Build output. `shopify app build` compiles src/index.js to WASM with Javy
# and rewrites both of these every time, so committing them only produces
# binary conflicts.
extensions/*/dist/

# Typegen output. Regenerated from schema.graphql by the CLI during the build.
extensions/*/generated/

# schema.graphql is deliberately NOT ignored. The CLI only validates that file
# against the extension's api_version — it never fetches it during a build — so
# a clone without it cannot build until someone runs `shopify app function
# schema`, and the first symptom is a codegen failure rather than a missing
# file. Committed, the build is reproducible offline. Refresh it with that
# command whenever api_version changes.
